# Start from a frozen character and take one turn, so that Game::Play runs
# the door/lock probe (INCURSION_DOORPICK_PROBE, src/DoorPickProbe.cpp) before
# the first key. Used by tools/check_door_pick_kick.sh with INCURSION_LOAD
# set. The probe does all the work; the key script only has to reach play.
@dump:arrival
s
@dump:played
